  "title": "NVMEoF: enhance NVMeOF fabric commands and responses code.",
  "description": "There are two implementations for parsing NVMEoF fabric commands -- one in packet-nvme-rdma.c, and one in packet-nvme-tcp.c.\n\nThe first implementation is nearly complete, while the TCP is rather partial.\n\nThere really shall be a single implementation in packet-nvme.c, which is called by RDMA or TCP, as it is done for non-fabric commands and completions.\n\nAdditionally, I have completed fabric commands handling, and unified CQE dissect for fabric and non-fabric commands.",
