        {
          "id": 600186344,
          "type": null,
          "body": "added 12 commits\n\n<ul><li>38c9ed09...5e2a8f37 - 3 commits from branch <code>wireshark:master</code></li><li>7874e016 - NVMeOF Connect command decoding fixes.</li><li>c4729419 - NVMEoF: rename rdma fields names to nvmeof.</li><li>d576719d - NVMeOF: move handling of NVMeOF fabric commands, fabric completions and fabric...</li><li>0b101d54 - NVMeOF fabric commands: support offset in commands and completions dissectors.</li><li>45201049 - NVMeOF fabric commands: switch TCP dissect to common NVMe code.</li><li>8bc0924c - NVMeOF fabric commands: simplify decoding code using field definitions.</li><li>c7e082c6 - NVMe: use common block for decoding CQEs for fabric and IO commands.</li><li>5d35e28e - NVMeOF: complete decoding of fabric commands.</li><li>74a3fac0 - NVMeOF: rename fields to pass code validation.</li></ul>\n\n[Compare with previous version](/wireshark/wireshark/-/merge_requests/3322/diffs?diff_id=199925848&start_sha=38c9ed09960c9f558e66482f83a5c8b61d1d488d)",
